  "description": "*\"You are mine now.\"* \n\nThe long struggle between the Yong-Ju faction and the Dongmoon faction ended with the victory of the Dongmoon faction. At this final moment, the number two of the Dongmoon faction, Sung Jae-Ha, approaches the omega of the Yongju faction, Yoo Ha-Min. After a long wait, he finally gets to sit next to Ha-Min. Will Jae-Ha be able to make Ha-Min's color his own? Or will it be the beginning of another tragedy?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
